; Run 3 on OPS-SAT PRETTY (exp4051), segment 1: the shrinking quorum on the
; faults that flew in run 1, commanded through F´ as an operator would. All
; commands run before cycle 1; each fault waits for its cycle in FaultInjector.
;   cycle  60  one bit flip in replica 2's computation: outvoted, a strike
;   cycle 120  replica 1 returns the same wrong value: outvoted three times,
;              fails its known-answer test and is retired
;   cycle 240  replica 0 stops answering: lost after three silent cycles;
;              replica 2 goes on alone in self-check
; SET_UPSETS sets no random upsets and seed 1, the demo's seed, so the
; corrupted bit is the one the demo would pick.
R00:00:00 MruOpsSat.manager.SET_POLICY SHRINK
R00:00:00 MruOpsSat.injector.SET_UPSETS 0.0 0.05 1
R00:00:00 MruOpsSat.injector.INJECT CORRUPT 2 60
R00:00:00 MruOpsSat.injector.INJECT STUCK 1 120
R00:00:00 MruOpsSat.injector.INJECT KILL 0 240
